.001,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"You’d rather not be responsible for two deaths in the one family, so you lie your pants off.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.352,"end":5.984,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"large":{"start":0.352,"end":5.984,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"\"You just ordered thirty barrels of rum. Either you're setting sail, or you're planning a twenty-first birthday. Look, I know everything my father knew and I can winch a capstan faster than he could. I'll see you at the dock.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":6.368,"end":19.584,"frac":0.976,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":41},"large":{"start":6.368,"end":19.584,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Before you can protest further, she makes a b-line for your ship. Well, you do need the crew, and her father was a capable sailor when he wasn't dead, or dead drunk.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":20.0,"end":30.24,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"large":{"start":20.0,"end":30.24,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":32,"words":33},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You look at your watch, time’s passing too quickly, and you're keenly aware that Neckbeard is out there recruiting his own pirates. If you're going to beat him to the treasure you'll need to set sail on the next tide.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":31.008,"end":41.792,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":40},"large":{"start":31.008,"end":41.72,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":40,"words":40},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"There are two scurvy dogs you've worked with in the past. But you'll only have time to acquire one of these pirates. There's a navigator, and a quartermaster.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":42.176,"end":50.368,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":28},"large":{"start":42.176,"end":49.86,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":28,"words":28},"differ":true},{"i":5,"text":"Who is more essential?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":51.84,"end":53.44,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":4},"large":{"start":49.86,"end":53.02,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":4},"differ":true},{"i":6,"text":"Look for the navigator, a man of science, who will help plot your course.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":53.952,"end":58.144,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"large":{"start":53.952,"end":57.82,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":58.592,"end":58.9,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":58.592,"end":58.68,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"Look for the quartermaster, a fearsome fighter, who will help steer the ship.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":59.584,"end":64.032,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":13},"large":{"start":59.584,"end":64.032,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":13},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6901745627e04_JM5.jpg"}